## Notes / limits

- **URL rewriting:** neither the sidecar nor the JWT-trust path rewrites URLs inside HTML/JS bodies. If the
  app fetches root-absolute API paths (e.g. `fetch("/api/data")`), those will escape the embed prefix and
  land at the platform origin — not the app. Derive the base path from `window.location.pathname` in the
  frontend JS. See the worked example in `marketplace/Implementation/08-worked-example-weather-app.md`.
- **JWT-trust security:** the patch decodes the JWT without re-verifying the signature — safe only when the
  pod is reachable exclusively through the platform proxy. Apply a NetworkPolicy restricting ingress to the
  marketplace proxy.

Full background: `marketplace/Implementation/` (end-to-end onboarding guide).
